<img data-src="https://mbt-essays-prod-public.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/64968/listing/64968_1.jpg" alt="Why did the Liberals concentrate on poverty? 1906-11." width="138" height="172" loading="lazy" class="rounded product-image-page lazyload" style="position: relative; z-index: 1;">
